  "texts": {
    "preamble": "D. Sudheer Kumar vs The State Of Telangana on 13 August, 2024 Author: B. Vijaysen Reddy Bench: B. Vijaysen Reddy Honourable Sri Justice B. Vijaysen Reddy Writ Petition No.21365 Of 2024 Order:",
    "facts": "He observed that the owners of wine shops are not maintaining the wine shops strictly in accordance with the conditions of license and are doing illegal business by selling food in the permit rooms which is illegal as per the Excise Act. The petitioner suffered illness due to unhygienic conditions in the wine shop. The petitioner made several oral complaints to the respondent authorities to take action against the wine shops who are conducting business contrary to the conditions laid down in the conditions of license.",
    "arguments": "The petitioner has not made any specific complaint against the wine shops."
  },
